## 13. Safety Notes

* Always verify the voltage requirements of the exact sensor module before powering it.
* ESP32 GPIO pins must not receive 5V signals.
* Use a resistor with LEDs.
* Use a transistor/MOSFET driver for high-current loads.
* Connect all modules to a common ground where appropriate.
* MQ-series sensors require warm-up time and calibration for reliable readings.
* Sensor readings shown by the prototype should be treated as experimental unless properly calibrated and validated.

